&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helsing is a defence AI company. Our mission is to protect our democracies. We aim to achieve technological leadership, so that open societies can continue to make sovereign decisions and control their ethical standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As democracies, we believe we have a special responsibility to be thoughtful about the development and deployment of powerful technologies like AI. We take this responsibility seriously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are an ambitious and committed team of engineers, AI specialists and customer-facing programme managers.&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are looking for mission-driven people to join our European teams – and apply their skills to solve the most complex and impactful problems. We embrace an open and transparent culture that welcomes healthy debates on the use of technology in defence, its benefits, and its ethical implications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;The-grand-scheme.2&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9097&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;ad4af9114b52&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;At Helsing, our engineering culture is defined by technical impact, first-principles thinking, and high-agency execution. We are looking for a hands-on Staff Software Engineer to serve as a primary technical anchor, driving architectural decisions and shipping code across our backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;609cdcbb3ea2&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Designed for a builder who thrives on complexity and wants to remain close to the metal, you will have the autonomy to own projects from zero to one prototyping through to deploying resilient software on physical hardware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;dc1ac9e9b5d0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your impact is measured by your ability to design robust systems, write performance-optimised code, and act as a technical multiplier for our teams. You will architect solutions across highly resilient distributed systems built for network partitions, resource-constrained embedded hardware, secure networking protocols, and high-performance machine learning inference pipelines directly at the tactical edge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-local-id=&quot;60018734ea0c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;6d44d57b-b4bc-47f0-82fe-058e3082a7d0&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;6d44d57b-b4bc-47f0-82fe-058e3082a7d0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;annotation&quot;&gt;The day-to-day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;13ca4add4cff&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;6213aee7f5ce&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;1d5fcca9ba22&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead the review of complex code contributions, design proposals, and technical RFCs from colleagues. At Helsing we strongly believe that unblocking others and mentoring is the highest-leverage work you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;d462da53a44e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;e951e48770b1&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Architect, propose, and implement major new features, capabilities, algorithms, infrastructure, or full products across our stack. We expect our engineers to look beyond their immediate team, identify systemic opportunities, and champion the solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;71cff2ad-48d0-4666-8e7b-56e8a3777ad6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;4bba6cfc20de&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Act as a key translator between engineering and the broader business. You will regularly interface with product managers, programme leads, and customers to translate deep technical designs and constraints into clear, actionable insights for non-technical stakeholders who depend on our technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;9728a212b1b2&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;b520360dae1e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Actively mentor engineers, find mentees, and help drive and scale our technical interviewing pipeline. You will be a key driver in fostering, growing, and scaling the engineering organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;12e95fda9ccb&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;d892828b325e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Share your extensive experience and technical know-how with other Helsingers. We host tech talks, run &quot;let’s learn together&quot; groups, and host topical office hours (e.g., on Rust) to help the entire engineering team get better with time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;a91e09471931&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;41f11942ccdf&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Maintain and evolve our existing software stack, partnering with internal and external stakeholders to diagnose complex system issues, optimise operational reliability and performance, and systematically address technical debt. Our stack is a mix of Rust and Python, with Python mainly living in the ML-heavy sections.&lt;/p&gt;
